  "notes": "Level 4 Manananggal-7 boss (issue #50). Source cells plant the assembled unit at about 376 px tall and pack at scale 0.5, matching the Sigbin atlas convention (rendered at ENEMY_LOOK scale 2 so the body is about half of the 672x378 screen). Frames face right. No painted weak-point diamond; the renderer draws the shared magenta #ff2d78 diamond with a white outline. Row 0 idle (whole body), row 1 stalk, row 2 attack, row 3 split then hurt, row 4 death then upper_shoot, row 5 fly (upper half, centre pivot), row 6 lower_idle, lower_shoot, lower_death. components.bridge and minArea keep wings, spine cables and exhaust as one frame.",
